/Pt{2 mul dup 8a exch get exch 1 add 8a exch get}def

%  a0 a1 mirrorang ma
%	If a0 is the angle from p1 to p0 and a1 is the angle from
%	p1 to p2 then ma is the mirror angle between p0-p1 and p1-p2.
%  a0 a1 afactor f
